          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbĩthukĩĩsyai, inyw’ĩ ala mũvikĩlaa ũlũngalu, inyw’ĩ ala mũmanthaa Yeova; sisyai ĩvia vala mwasũviw’e; na ĩima ĩliku vala mwenziwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sisyai Avalaamu ĩthe wenyu na Sala ũla wamũsyaie ĩnyw’ĩ; nũndũ yĩla waĩ o ũmwe nĩnamwĩtie, na namũathima, na namũtw’ĩkĩthya aingĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
