        },
        {
          "text": "Amũka, amũka, ĩkĩa vinya, we kw’oko kwa Yeova, amũka, o ta mĩthenya ya tene, nzyawa sya tene tene. Tuue ũla watilangile Laavi ilungu, na ũla watonyie mũkũnga? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.9"
            ]
