              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tuue ũla wang’alilye ũkanga, manzĩ ma syũngũ nene; na ũla watw’ĩkĩthisye moliku ma ũkanga nzĩa ya ala moovoiw’e maingĩle? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
