          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na nĩwũlĩtwe nĩ Yeova Mũmbi waku, ũla watambũũkisye matu, na wambĩlĩlye myambĩlĩlyo ya nthĩ; na nũkĩaa mũthenya w’onthe mavinda onthe nũndũ wa ũthatu mwai wa mũthĩn’ya, yĩla wĩyũmbanasyai anange? Na ũthatu mwai wa mũthĩn’ya ũĩva? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
