        {
          "text": "Amũka, amũka, ũngama, we Yelusaleme, ũla ũnyw’ĩte kw’okonĩ kwa Yeova kĩkombe kya kũthilĩka kwake; we nũnyw’ĩte kĩkombe kĩnene kya kũlũsya, na ũkakĩmina. ",
